      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TariffQuota (TariffId, QuotaGB)\n-- 3 рядки, бо тарифів було мало:\n--   PLAN_A, 50\n--   PLAN_B, 100\n--   PLAN_C, 150",
